SUMMARY:ECOKids day at From the Ground Up Community Garden
DESCRIPTION:From the Ground Up Community Garden hosts ECOKids\, a free mor
 ning and early afternoon of nature learning for children. A play called O
 ld Plastic\, New Rules runs from 10 AM to 11 AM\, followed by a relay of 
 learning stations from 11 AM to 1 PM run by groups such as Dune Defenders
 \, Keep Pensacola Beautiful and the Navarre Beach Sea Turtle Conservation
  Center. Local kid musicians play from 1 PM to 2 PM. Admission is free.\n
